sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Gateway as Cổng Thanh Toán (VNPay/MoMo/Stripe)
    participant Svc as OrderPaymentService / RefundProcessingService
    participant Bus as Spring ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant PayListener as PaymentNotificationEventListener
    participant RefListener as RefundNotificationEventListener
    participant NotifUC as SendNotificationUseCase
    participant Repo as JpaNotificationRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Note over Gateway, DB: Kiến Trúc Hướng Sự Kiện: Thông Báo Thanh Toán & Hoàn Tiền (R5)

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Gateway, DB: Kịch bản 1: Thanh toán thành công (PaymentSuccessEvent)
        Gateway->>Svc: Webhook / Callback xác nhận thanh toán thành công
        activate Svc
        Svc->>Svc: Cập nhật PaymentStatus = SUCCESS, MasterOrder = PAID
        Svc->>Svc: ConfirmBookingUseCase.execute(...)
        Svc->>Bus: publishEvent(new PaymentSuccessEvent(orderId, customerId, bookingId))
        deactivate Svc

        Bus->>PayListener: @EventListener handlePaymentSuccess(event)
        activate PayListener
        PayListener->>PayListener: Kiểm tra Order hợp lệ & trạng thái PAID

        Note over PayListener, NotifUC: 1. Tạo thông báo In-App cho Khách hàng (Deduplicated Idempotency Key)
        PayListener->>NotifUC: executeOnce(NotificationCommand, key: "payment:{orderId}:customer:{customerId}")
        activate NotifUC
        NotifUC->>Repo: save(NotificationJpaEntity)
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications (...) ON CONFLICT (idempotency_key) DO NOTHING
        deactivate NotifUC

        Note over PayListener, NotifUC: 2. Quét danh sách SubOrders để thông báo cho từng Vendor
        loop Với mỗi SubOrder của MasterOrder
            PayListener->>PayListener: Lấy vendor.userId từ vendorId (tránh gửi trùng)
            PayListener->>NotifUC: executeOnce(NotificationCommand, key: "payment:{orderId}:vendor:{vendorId}")
            activate NotifUC
            NotifUC->>Repo: save(NotificationJpaEntity)
            Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications (...)
            deactivate NotifUC
        end
        deactivate PayListener
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
        Note over Gateway, DB: Kịch bản 2: Hoàn tiền thành công (RefundCompletedEvent)
        Gateway->>Svc: Webhook / Polling xác nhận Refund PROCESSED
        activate Svc
        Svc->>Svc: Cập nhật Refund.status = PROCESSED
        Svc->>Bus: publishEvent(new RefundCompletedEvent(refundId, subOrderId, orderId, customerId, amount, PROCESSED))
        deactivate Svc

        Bus->>RefListener: @EventListener handleRefundCompleted(event)
        activate RefListener

        Note over RefListener, NotifUC: Tạo thông báo In-App bồi hoàn cho Khách hàng
        RefListener->>NotifUC: executeOnce(NotificationCommand, key: "refund:{refundId}:customer:{customerId}")
        activate NotifUC
        NotifUC->>Repo: save(NotificationJpaEntity)
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications (...)
        deactivate NotifUC
        deactivate RefListener
    end
